    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "大嘴巴’的意思是：你的嘴巴守不住事情，一有什么事情就想告诉别人。”",
      "traditional": "大嘴巴’的意思是：你的嘴巴守不住事情，一有什麼事情就想告訴別人。”",
      "pinyin": "dà zuǐ ba de yì si shì nǐ de zuǐ ba shǒu bú zhù shì qing yì yǒu shén me shì qing jiù xiǎng gào su bié ren",
      "english": "Mom laughed and said: “I’m not saying your mouth is big."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "‘Big mouth’ means your mouth is unable to keep anything secret. As soon as something comes up you want to tell others.”"
    },
