    "sentence_translations": [
      "My Mouth Is Not Big",
      "",
      "One day, Little Ming said to his mom, ..",
      ".. “I told our teacher that we are going on a family trip next week. My teacher told us to have fun.”",
      "",
      "Mom said, “Little Ming, you really are a big mouth.”",
      "",
      "“Big mouth?” Little Ming said, “Mom, my mouth isn’t big!”",
      "",
      "Mom laughed and said: “I’m not saying your mouth is big.",
      "‘Big mouth’ means your mouth is unable to keep anything secret. As soon as something comes up you want to tell others.”",
      "",
      "After hearing this, Little Ming also laughed and said, “Then dad is also a big mouth!",
      "Dad told me that when you were little you used to be a crybaby.”"
    ]
